  "domain": "Pre-engagement activities, legal concepts, and compliance frameworks",
  "type": "dragdrop",
  "prompt": "Match each compliance consideration to the regulation or standard that most directly governs it in a penetration testing context.",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A multinational organization is preparing multiple concurrent penetration tests. The engagement manager must map specific compliance drivers to the correct regulatory framework so that scoping documents and authorization letters contain the required language.</p></div>",
