  "prompt": "Which of the following are recognized components of pre-engagement scope definition according to CompTIA PenTest+ objectives?",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A candidate is preparing for the PT0-003 examination and is reviewing the official exam objectives for Domain 1.0 Engagement Management. The candidate must correctly identify the elements that fall under “Summarize pre-engagement activities.”</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
