  "prompt": "Match each ROE component to the operational question it answers.",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A new tester is learning how to read and apply a Rules of Engagement document. Correct association of each section with the question it resolves is required before the tester may begin fieldwork.</p></div>",
