  "prompt": "Which of the following is the most precise and verifiable way to express an in-scope network range?",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A client has provided a list of assets for an external assessment. The scoping document must define the authorized IP space so that both the testing team and the client’s SOC can unambiguously distinguish in-scope from out-of-scope traffic.</p></div>",
