  "prompt": "Which elements must be explicitly defined inside the Rules of Engagement document?",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A project manager is finalizing the ROE for a gray-box web-application and internal-network assessment. The document must contain every operational constraint required by the client and the testing firm.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
