  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A senior consultant is mentoring a junior team member on report structure. The junior consultant must correctly identify the content that belongs in the executive summary.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
