  "prompt": "Match each target-selection artifact to the most precise technical representation that should appear in the scoping document.",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An engagement manager is converting a client’s informal asset list into formal scope language that will be referenced by both the authorization letter and the ROE.</p></div>",
