  "prompt": "Identify the line that incorrectly expands the authorized testing window beyond what the client has approved.",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The client has authorized testing only during non-business hours (22:00–06:00 local time). A draft ROE contains the following statements.</p></div>",
