  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An internal directory service exposes LDAP to a network segment included in the assessment scope. The tester is identifying directory information that could assist later attack-path analysis.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
