  "prompt": "Match each persistence mechanism to its primary trigger or execution model.",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A tester is building a persistence assessment matrix covering Windows and Linux hosts. Match each mechanism to the event that normally causes the configured code or service to execute.</p></div>",
