  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A tester has obtained a foothold on an enterprise workstation and is establishing the host's identity, network position, and security context before considering further movement.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
