  "prompt": "Select THREE types of Active Directory information that can help identify lateral-movement opportunities.",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An assessor is performing authorized directory enumeration after obtaining a domain account. The objective is to understand relationships and privileged resources without immediately modifying the environment.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
