  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The topology contains a tester on 192.168.1.0/24, a compromised server with interfaces on both 192.168.1.0/24 and 172.16.10.0/24, and an internal database on 172.16.10.0/24.</p></div>",
