  "prompt": "Which findings can help identify potential lateral-movement paths in an Active Directory environment?",
  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The tester is correlating directory and endpoint information to understand where the current account may have meaningful access.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly FOUR</h3></div>",
