  "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The tester is collecting authorized directory telemetry to construct a graph of users, computers, groups, sessions, and permissions.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
