  "scenario": "<div class=\\\"scenario-text\\\"><p>After an initial host-discovery sweep, the tester needs to identify listening services and their version information under the authorized scope.</p></div><div class=\\\"requirements-box\\\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
