  "scenario": "<div class=\\\"scenario-text\\\"><p>The tester is converting raw scan data into a reliable inventory of in-scope hosts and services for later phases.</p></div><div class=\\\"requirements-box\\\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
